  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款用于玩具拼搭结构的ABS透明硬质管件，适合与连接球、支架等配件组合使用，常见于儿童帐篷和拼插类结构玩具场景。\n\n品牌为尧顺，产地东莞茶山，支持批量供货，可用于标准化拼搭结构件配套。",
    "en": "This is an ABS transparent rigid tube component for toy construction structures. It is suitable for use with connector balls and support parts in kids fort and interlocking build systems.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Origin: Chashan, Dongguan. It supports bulk supply for standardized structural component matching."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款ABS透明硬质玩具拼搭管为结构类配件，主要用于拼搭模型、帐篷框架与连接支撑结构，可与多种节点件配合使用。",
      "产品强调尺寸稳定和装配兼容性，适合用于儿童创意拼搭、教具结构搭建和活动场景道具的模块化组合。",
      "配套参数包含重量与材料牌号信息，便于渠道进行规格管理、批量采购与长期供货协同。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This ABS transparent rigid toy tube is a structural accessory used in construction models, fort frames, and connection support assemblies, and can be matched with multiple joint components.",
      "The product focuses on dimensional stability and assembly compatibility, making it suitable for kids creative construction, educational structure kits, and modular event props.",
      "Specification data includes unit weight and material grade details, supporting channel-level specification management, batch purchasing, and long-term supply coordination."
    ]
  },
